<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts Thistle.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts Thistle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thistle Hotels Plc was rated &quot;market outperformer&quot; as Goldman started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
